Destek bölgesinde olduğumuzu düşünüyorum ancak satış baskısı çok yüksek spotlardan ciddi bir satış baskısı mevcut. Bir dönüş emaresi vs görürsem alım düşünüyorum.

Ayrıca son raporda da olan, hemen her yere iliştirdiğim yazıyı da bu vesileyle tekrar görsel olarak paylaşayım.</span></div><div class="relative"><div class="aspect-[25/17] overflow-hidden"><div class="scrollbar-hide flex h-full min-h-0 snap-x snap-mandatory gap-2 overflow-x-auto [&amp;::-webkit-scrollbar]:hidden"><div class="h-full min-h-0 w-[85%] shrink-0 snap-center overflow-hidden rounded-md border border-gray-200"><div class="relative h-full w-full"><div inert="" class="h-full w-full"><a aria-label="Image" class="block h-full w-full cursor-zoom-in appearance-none border-none bg-transparent p-0 text-inherit" href="/Efloud/status/1990677429321379855/photo/1"><img alt="" class="h-full w-full object-cover" loading="eager" fetchPriority="high" width="3286" height="1770" src="https://pbs.twimg.com/media/G6BOcX2X0AAOMo8?format=webp&amp;name=medium" srcSet="https://pbs.twimg.com/media/G6BOcX2X0AAOMo8?format=webp&amp;name=small 680w, https://pbs.twimg.com/media/G6BOcX2X0AAOMo8?format=webp&amp;name=medium 1200w, https://pbs.twimg.com/media/G6BOcX2X0AAOMo8?format=webp&amp;name=large 2048w" sizes="(max-width: 600px) calc(100vw - 80px), 600px"/></a></div><a aria-label="View media" class="absolute inset-0 z-10" href="/Efloud/status/1990677429321379855/photo/1"></a></div></div><div class="h-full min-h-0 w-[85%] shrink-0 snap-center overflow-hidden rounded-md border border-gray-200"><div class="relative h-full w-full"><div inert="" class="h-full w-full"><a aria-label="Image" class="block h-full w-full cursor-zoom-in appearance-none border-none bg-transparent p-0 text-inherit" href="/Efloud/status/1990677429321379855/photo/2"><img alt="" class="h-full w-full object-cover" loading="lazy" width="1854" height="430" src="https://pbs.twimg.com/media/G6BOkbtWcAAy12B?format=webp&amp;name=medium" srcSet="https://pbs.twimg.com/media/G6BOkbtWcAAy12B?format=webp&amp;name=small 680w, https://pbs.twimg.com/media/G6BOkbtWcAAy12B?format=webp&amp;name=medium 1200w, https://pbs.twimg.com/media/